### ==================== STUDENT PREFERENCES ====================

### Get Preferences (auto-creates if doesn't exist)
GET {{url}}/api/preferences/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Create/Update Preferences
POST {{url}}/api/preferences/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "preferred_subjects": ["MATHEMATICS", "PHYSICS", "CHEMISTRY"],
    "preferred_career_fields": ["Engineering", "Computer Science", "Data Science"],
    "preferred_institutions": ["University of Nairobi", "JKUAT", "Strathmore"],
    "location_preference": "Nairobi"
}

### Update Preferences (Partial)
PATCH {{url}}/api/preferences/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "location_preference": "Mombasa",
    "preferred_career_fields": ["Medicine", "Pharmacy", "Nursing"]
}

### Update Only Preferred Subjects
PATCH {{url}}/api/preferences/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "preferred_subjects": ["BIOLOGY", "CHEMISTRY", "PHYSICS"]
}


### Get all active psychometric questions
GET {{url}}/api/assessment/questions/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get questions by category (RIASEC)
GET {{url}}/api/assessment/questions/?category=REALISTIC
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get questions by category (Big Five)
GET {{url}}/api/assessment/questions/?category=OPENNESS
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Create new question (Admin only)
POST {{url}}/api/assessment/questions/manage/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question_text": "I enjoy working with tools and machinery",
    "category": "REALISTIC"
}


# ------Psychometric Questions Management (Admin only)------
### Create multiple questions (Admin only)
POST {{url}}/api/assessment/questions/manage/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question_text": "I like conducting experiments and analyzing data",
    "category": "INVESTIGATIVE"
}

###
