### Update a question (Admin only)
PATCH {{url}}/api/assessment/questions/manage/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question_text": "I enjoy working with tools, machinery, and building things",
    "is_active": true
}

### Soft delete a question (Admin only)
DELETE {{url}}/api/assessment/questions/manage/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Submit batch responses (recommended for complete test)
POST {{url}}/api/assessment/submit/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "responses": [
        {"question_id": 1, "response_value": 5},
        {"question_id": 2, "response_value": 4},
        {"question_id": 3, "response_value": 3},
        {"question_id": 4, "response_value": 5},
        {"question_id": 5, "response_value": 4},
        {"question_id": 6, "response_value": 2}
    ]
}

